/scripts/not_same.py

# Public-template defaults: keep personal records and host settings out of source commits.
# A private project may opt into tracking records; see docs/publication.md.
# Git alone is never a complete backup: .hl contains required private state and keys.
/.hl/
/hl.toml
/log/
/plan.yaml
/defaults.yaml
/foods/
.env
.env.*
/.claude/
/.codex/

# Complete upstream nutrition snapshots stay in the private development repository.
# Private maintainers add these intentionally; public exports include only their index.
/data/foods/raw/
/data/foods/compiled/
